{"messages": [{"id": 667362227, "body": "$NVDA \nAI bears are popping champagne because a NeoCloud\u2019s stock chart looks like a ski slope. They think a bankruptcy means the GPUs vanish into thin air.\n\nSorry to ruin the victory lap, but the physical data center is still there. The gigawatt power contract is still live. The liquid-cooled clusters are still plugged in.\n\nA default doesn&#39;t erase the infrastructure; it just flushes out the bad equity and hands a turn-key, high-performance computing asset to Nvidia and senior lenders for pennies on the dollar. The tech didn&#39;t fail- the capital structure did. Enjoy the paper victories while the adults take over the real estate.", "created_at": "2026-10-26T15:09:34Z", "discussion": false, "source": {"id": 2095, "title": "StockTwits For Android ", "url": "http://www.stocktwits.com/mobile"}, "prices": [{"id": 2925, "symbol": "NVDA", "symbol_mic": "NVDA.XNAS", "price": "217.42"}], "mentioned_users": [], "entities": {"media": [], "sentiment": {"basic": "Bullish"}, "discussable": null}, "user": {"id": 5976911, "username": "BeChoosy", "name": "BeChoosy", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.stocktwits.com/production/5976911/thumb-1763112843.png", "avatar_url_ssl": "https://avatars.stocktwits.com/production/5976911/thumb-1763112843.png", "join_date": "2021-10-10", "official": false, "identity": "User", "classification": [], "badges": [], "home_country": "US", "search_regions": [], "followers": 267, "following": 4, "ideas": 8138, "watchlist_stocks_count": 46, "like_count": 518, "plus_tier": "", "premium_room": "", "trade_app": false, "trade_status": "PENDING_MFA"}, "likes": {"total": 2, "user_ids": [11016909, 3905677]}, "symbols": [{"id": 2925, "symbol": "NVDA", "symbol_mic": "NVDA.XNAS", "symbol_display": "NVDA", "exchange": "NASDAQ", "region": "US", "logo_url": "https://logos.stocktwits-cdn.com/NVDA.png", "title": "NVIDIA Corp", "aliases": [], "deeplink": "symbol/NVDA", "external_id": null, "is_following": false, "watchli